          "title": "keine in the plural",
          "body": "There's no plural *a*: *Es gibt Cafés* = there are cafés.\n\nBut **kein** does have a plural: before any plural noun, it's **keine**.\n\nIt works after *haben* too: *Ich habe keine Kinder.*",
          "examples": [
            { "text": "Es gibt keine Hotels.", "translation": "There are no hotels." },
            { "text": "Es gibt keine Kinos.", "translation": "There are no cinemas." },
